  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Petrochemical Sector, through Gas Technology Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) supports U.S. private sector participation in the development of petrochemical production infrastructure in India. The RTM supports the Government of India&apos;s intent to improve and expand petrochemical production and U.S. industry&apos;s desire to expand their presence in the Indian market.</narrative>
